	"Version": 1,
	"VersionName": "2.0",
	"FriendlyName": "FANTASIA ACE (UE 5.7 only - NOT available for UE 5.8)",
	"Description": "NOT AVAILABLE FOR UE 5.8: do not enable this plugin on UE 5.8. Its binaries are built for UE 5.7, and the NVIDIA ACE plugins it depends on (NV_ACE_Reference) have not been ported to UE 5.8 - NVIDIA ships them for UE 5.6 only, so each engine version needs a hand-port. The UE 5.8 release of FANTASIA is core-only; core FANTASIA is unaffected and still produces audio. For Audio2Face lip-sync, use the UE 5.7 line (the 5.7 branch of the repository). ---- Optional companion plugin to FANTASIA: adds NVIDIA Audio2Face lip-sync via UACERESTTTSComponent.",
	"Category": "Other",
	"CreatedBy": "Antonio Origlia",
	"CreatedByURL": "",
